# ## Step 2 — The Contract Chunking Problem
#
# We have a 50-page employment contract. A user asks: **"What is the severance clause?"**
#
# If we chunk naively (fixed 512-token chunks), the retriever might return the cover page instead of the relevant section buried 15 pages in. This lesson teaches six strategies to fix that.
#
# Let's start by generating a synthetic contract excerpt to work with:

# %%
